<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · site</p><h1 class="enc-title">Metulum</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Metulum was the main stronghold of the Iapydes, an <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/iron-age">Iron Age</a> people of the north-western <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/balkans">Balkans</a>, in what is now <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/croatia">Croatia</a>. In 35 BCE Octavian besieged it during his Illyrian campaign and was wounded in the assault. The defenders burned their town rather than surrender.</p></div>
